WEBVTT

00:03:58.821 --> 00:04:01.491
chuqurroq o’rganishga undaydi.

00:04:01.491 --> 00:04:04.424
Tana haqida biz bilgan barcha 
bilimlarga qaramasdan,

00:04:04.424 --> 00:04:07.450
platsebo effektiga o’xshash ayrim 
g’alati va ochilmagan

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:09.184
sir-asrorlar hali hanuz barhayot.

00:04:09.184 --> 00:04:13.404
Xo’sh yana qanday ajoyibotlar 
egasi bo’lishimiz mumkin?

00:04:13.404 --> 00:04:15.622
Atrofimizdagi dunyoni o’rganishga 
sho’ng’ib,

00:04:15.622 --> 00:04:18.746
uning eng ajabtovur xilqatlaridan biri 
ko’z oldimizda ekanligini

00:04:18.746 --> 00:04:21.026
unutib qo’yish oson.